WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:05.893
- I do however, have
for you a proposition.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.500
(birds chirping)

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.623
You take the hand of
my daughter, Catherine,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.013
in marriage.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:20.787
(joyful orchestral music)

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:25.459
(wood creaking)
(footsteps thumping)

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:27.395
(footsteps thumping)

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:30.260
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.343
(footsteps thumping)

00:00:41.355 --> 00:00:45.231
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:46.130
(coughing)

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:49.213
(footsteps thumping)

00:00:51.891 --> 00:00:53.294
(distant crowd shouting)

00:00:53.294 --> 00:00:55.188
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:58.115
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:58.115 --> 00:01:02.307
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:03.755
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:03.755 --> 00:01:06.064
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:06.064 --> 00:01:09.814
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:11.116 --> 00:01:14.260
(distant bell tolling)

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.883
- May as much I wonder
about a great many things.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.440
- Indeed there must be for
you to contemplate marriage

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:26.628
to a woman about whom you know so little.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:27.461
- Mm.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.113
- I will not submit to you.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.173
You must earn my respect.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:40.463
- I understand that.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.630
- Do you?

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:44.463
- [Man] I do.

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:48.613
- Do you feel a sense of achievement?

00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.073
- In what regard?

00:01:53.073 --> 00:01:54.340
- [Catherine] In any regard.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:57.310
- I have achieved that
which my father never could.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.040
I have united this
kingdom in common cause.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:00.873
- Hmm.

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:05.243
You have achieved momentary respite.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.880
A unity forged under false pretense

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.490
will never be a unity that prevails.

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.513
- How, pray, have my
endeavors been forged falsely?

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.900
- Why did you bring war to France?

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.553
- Your father came on spoiling.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.633
- Oh, so how was he spoiling?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.780
- He sent an assassin.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.980
- There was no assassin.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.450
There was no plot to kill you.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.070
- How might you know?

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:38.400
- Because I was with my father

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.060
when you received word of your charge.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.960
I know him well enough to know
his reaction to be genuine.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.790
- How was his reaction?

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.633
- He laughed.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.160
He laughed very much.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.460
He said you must be drunk.

00:02:54.731 --> 00:02:55.981
- Your father's a madman.

00:02:57.117 --> 00:02:59.670
- He may be mad, but he's true.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.210
His madness makes him true.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:03.510
This is only what he believes.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:04.843
That is why he is loved.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:09.420
- The assassin then was
sent by your brother.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.393
- [Catherine] My brother?

00:03:10.393 --> 00:03:11.226
- Mm-Hmm.

00:03:11.226 --> 00:03:13.153
- My brother was too stupid
to conjure such a plan.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.590
What was your true reason?

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.340
- Did you know of the ball he sent?

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.173
The ball he sent to me?

00:03:25.951 --> 00:03:26.784
- A ball?

00:03:30.419 --> 00:03:33.050
He sent to you a ball?

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:34.850
- Why should you question my intent?

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.290
Your father's rule is illegitimate.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.190
He has not right claim to his throne.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.163
- All monarchy is illegitimate.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.120
You yourself are the son of a usurper.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.310
It would seem that you have no explanation

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.460
for what you have done.

00:03:58.450 --> 00:03:59.330
You have shed the blood

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.423
of so many Christian souls and yet,

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.840
before me now, all I see

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:09.840
is a young and vain and
foolish man so easily riled.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.407
So easily beguiled.

00:04:26.587 --> 00:04:27.839
- I must leave you now.

00:04:27.839 --> 00:04:30.824
(slow dramatic orchestral music)

00:04:30.824 --> 00:04:33.491
(wood creaking)

00:04:34.657 --> 00:04:36.220
(footsteps thumping)

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:37.561
(distant crowd shouting)

00:04:37.561 --> 00:04:39.192
(crowd speaking in foreign language)

00:04:39.192 --> 00:04:40.025
- My liege.

00:04:40.025 --> 00:04:40.942
- My liege.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.133
- I ask nothing of you.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.760
Only that you will always
speak to me clear and true.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:07.933
Always.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.933
Will you promise me only that?

00:05:16.246 --> 00:05:17.079
(crowd chanting)

00:05:17.079 --> 00:05:17.912
- I will.

00:05:22.579 --> 00:05:25.329
(crowd chanting)

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:28.478
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:05:28.478 --> 00:05:30.331
- [Crowd] Praise Henry!

00:05:30.331 --> 00:05:31.414
Praise Henry!

00:05:32.356 --> 00:05:33.439
Praise Henry!

00:05:34.628 --> 00:05:35.711
Praise Henry!

